{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54745","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"土星合，相犯必爲灾。\n分野居（京本作「老」、辛本作「若」）当须有事，本藩太守祸之胎，修德免灾（京本作「殃」）来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}